## Flow UI / A2A compatibility matrix

Обязательные suites проверяют consumer-visible parity, а не private reducer names:

- all `text|raw|url|data`, mixed Parts, arbitrary Artifact names/metadata/extensions для blocking stream/Get/List/Subscribe/restart/outbound remote client;
- append/replace/lastChunk/order/idempotency/stable artifact IDs;
- A2UI v0.9.1 official fixtures, extension/catalog negotiation и non-A2UI generic fallback без dual emit;
- durable UI delta/replay/OCC/autosync/forced flush/reopen/new device/same-context share;
- forged returned-state/effect/catalog/action/URL/ownership attacks;
- identical golden `PlatformEffect` ordering для Python/Node/Go/C# runners;
- universal renderer на SPA/editor/embed/landing/Lara/HITL и safe unknown Artifact projector;
- 4/8/12/nested grid, keyboard/a11y, RU/EN, theme/brand profiles.

Editor/runtime WYSIWYG suite запускает один production bundle в deterministic Chromium: сравнивает render-context fingerprints, semantic placements, DOM/a11y tree, geometry с zero-pixel tolerance и screenshot fixtures для canonical matrix page/panel/drawer/embed × desktop/tablet/mobile × light/dark × RU/EN × brands. Editor overlays не входят в production screenshot/DOM.

## Agent handoff (flows)

- Матрица: `tests/flows/integration/test_handoff_e2e.py`, `tests/flows/api/test_handoff_a2a.py`, `test_handoff_a2a_multi.py`.
- Только **MockLLM**; без monkeypatch orchestrator/settings (depth — через `assert_handoff_depth_allowed` или default config).
- **`sync_tools`:** `handoff_orchestrator_service` в patch list (`tests/conftest.py`).
- **MockLLM queue:** после `handback_to_parent` на child — текстовый ответ в очереди, иначе child перехватит parent `handoff_to_flow`.
- A2A multi-cycle: предпочтительно 2 HTTP-сообщения (start + reply chain при sync_tools).

Подробно — **`handoff.mdc`**.
